@startuml
participant "AI APP" as App
participant "MCP Server" as MCP
participant "Tool" as Tool

App -> MCP : Request available tools
MCP --> App : Send list of tools and their capabilities
note over App : AI APP chooses tool
App -> MCP : Call chosen tool
MCP -> Tool : Send tool request and data
note over Tool : Tool processes data
Tool --> MCP : Return result
MCP --> App : Send tool response
@enduml